  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3f3530c67f19311",
      "translationZh": "我开发 BitRun，是因为我想在普通笔记本电脑上运行 1-bit 三元大语言模型，而不必耗尽电池电量、启用独立 GPU，也不必折腾复杂的构建环境。目前，BitRun 在 Apple M4 Pro CPU 上可达到每秒 98 到 127 个 token，在 Intel Core i5 PC CPU 上可达到每秒 40 到 45 个 token，功耗极低，GPU 使用率为 0%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97fba223818037c1",
      "translationZh": "为了让它真正在现代硬件上运行起来，我不得不修复微软研究代码库（bitnet.cpp）中几个底层 C++ 内核的数学运算错误：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55012411ef244ad1",
      "translationZh": "内存步幅导致的数据覆盖：在 ggml-bitnet-mad.cpp 中，写回阶段忽略了批次步幅，导致计算完成的批次行在内存中悄无声息地相互覆盖。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efca25cdb1cc1f15",
      "translationZh": "ARM NEON 上的无限 @ @ @ 循环：ggml-cpu-i2s.c 中的块大小被硬编码为 64，而不是 GGUF 标准规定的 128 个元素。这个 50% 的指针运算偏移将错乱的字节送入了 NEON DotProd 加法器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9ce18b563f6c514",
      "translationZh": "激活函数不匹配：模型计算图使用 SiLU 初始化 FFN 门控，但 2.4B 模型训练时使用的是平方 ReLU。使用 SiLU 扭曲了激活值范围，并产生了乱码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae7993482309ab99",
      "translationZh": "多轮对话中的 BLAS 崩溃：当上下文超过 32 个 token 时，BLAS 会接管矩阵乘法，并因未对齐的字节偏移跳转到未映射的内存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb7739252f746ec7",
      "translationZh": "Windows MSVC 编译受阻：移除了人为设置的 CMake 检查，这些检查阻止了使用原生 Visual Studio 进行编译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af5a8636ab621700",
      "translationZh": "我已将这些修复提交给微软的上游项目：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e45919b9be8e8a29",
      "translationZh": "拉取请求 #644：https://github.com/microsoft/BitNet/pull/644",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce34afbd7f59a460",
      "translationZh": "随后，我将修补后的引擎打包进 BitRun，让任何人都能通过类似 Ollama 的工作流程，在 60 秒内测试三值模型。不需要 CMake，不需要 Clang 工具链，不需要 Python 虚拟环境，也不需要庞大的 Docker 镜像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a3b2aba20651bad",
      "translationZh": "如何运行（无需编译）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c46ae16ba925fbaf",
      "translationZh": "仅用 CPU 拉取模型并聊天：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1ea0ca18f485a23",
      "translationZh": "你也可以运行 \"bitrun serve falcon3-1b\"，在端口 11435 上启动一个兼容 OpenAI 的 REST 服务器（将 Cursor、Continue.dev 或 Open WebUI 指向它）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e1215edcf0664bb",
      "translationZh": "可以使用标准 Modelfiles 创建自定义角色设定（bitrun create engineer -f Modelfile）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "165e7714bea37ca7",
      "translationZh": "已验证的 CPU 速度（纯 CPU SIMD，0% GPU）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "366d9a3e639c6de2",
      "translationZh": "Apple M4 Pro CPU（12 核）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f6865d3b35f90640",
      "translationZh": "Falcon3 1B Instruct（约 1.30 GB）：98 至 127 tokens/sec（约 1.9 GB RAM）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "196faa2986bf710f",
      "translationZh": "BitNet b1.58 2.4B（约 1.13 GB）：约 40 tokens/sec（约 1.8 GB RAM）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "714b332716f37af4",
      "translationZh": "BitNet 70M（约 79 MB）：1,350+ tokens/sec（< 150 MB RAM）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "08762142ebd1fd4f",
      "translationZh": "Falcon3 1B Instruct：39 至 45 tokens/sec（提示词处理速度为 209.6 t/s）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9f1ea11f39aabdf",
      "translationZh": "BitNet 70M：492 词元/秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ecd72d3204ed1dd",
      "translationZh": "Linux（WSL2 / 4 核心，AVX2）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed951c12b51d30ff",
      "translationZh": "Falcon3 1B Instruct：40 到 45 tokens/sec",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0903bae765a5b89",
      "translationZh": "三值权重需要从头进行量化感知训练（QAT）。你不能直接拿一个现有的 70B FP16 模型，通过训练后量化将其降到 1.58-bit，而不毁掉它。正因如此，目前公开的模型目录仅限于参数量低于 3B 的模型（falcon3-1b、bitnet-2b、falcon3-3b、bitnet-70m）。它们无法取代 Claude 或 GPT-4 来完成高强度编程任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24f1136164a389d8",
      "translationZh": "不过，对于低功耗边缘设备、注重电池续航的笔记本电脑使用场景，以及希望仅靠 CPU 就能达到 100+ tokens/sec 的后台自动化任务，它现在就已经可以运行了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "593d7f99de5aaadf",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 仓库：https://github.com/IshekKhal/bitrun",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5490b8e5e2637378",
      "translationZh": "上游 PR：https://github.com/microsoft/BitNet/pull/642 和 https://github.com/microsoft/BitNet/pull/644",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c169a5701f2aa39",
      "translationZh": "预编译发布版本：https://github.com/IshekKhal/bitrun/releases/tag/v0.1.0-alpha",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a836824259fac0b",
      "translationZh": "如果你试用了，欢迎分享你的 CPU 基准测试数据！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
